##
## Filters for tests that fail only in MSAN builds on Linux
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# Upstream Chromium tests (crbug.com/490213796), fixed upstream but not on the
# 152 branch Brave pins. These are the only two tests in
# OmniboxAutofillDelegateFillingTest and they share one root cause:
# ~RoutingMockAutofillDriver() downcasts its client to MockAutofillClient to
# reach MockAutofillClient::router_, but the drivers are destroyed by the base
# ~TestAutofillClient(), i.e. after the MockAutofillClient sub-object is gone.
# Sanitizers that police the destroyed sub-object flag it: UBSan/CFI on the
# downcast itself, MSan on the subsequent read of the router's FormForest,
# because member storage is poisoned in destructors
# (msan_check_use_after_dtor defaults to true on Linux). Plain builds read the
# stale-but-intact memory and pass, which is why the aggregate upstream LUCI
# Analysis flake rate is 0.0% (144223 verdicts, 30-day lookback).
# Upstream first disabled both tests on Linux MSan/UBSan in
# crrev.com/c/8159001, then fixed them in crrev.com/c/8161485 (2026-07-28) by
# calling GetAutofillDriverFactory().DeleteAll() from ~MockAutofillClient().
# That fix landed after the 152 branch point and was not merged back, so
# upstream's "Linux MSan Tests" builder now passes (249/252 over 60 days)
# while Brave's linux-x64-msan nightly fails every run. This file rather than
# a -linux-ubsan one because every failure reported on both issues comes from
# linux-x64-msan; Brave's linux-x64-ubsan builder has not reported these
# tests. Brave has no chromium_src override or patch for the test file or for
# the autofill test client/driver infrastructure it uses, so no Brave code is
# involved. Remove once Brave rolls to Chromium 153.
# https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/58152
# https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/58151
-OmniboxAutofillDelegateFillingTest.FillOrPreviewCard_SubframeForm
-OmniboxAutofillDelegateFillingTest.FillOrPreviewCard_MainFrameForm
